    {
      "id": "1a8fab68-8eb9-4ed1-a7f2-a80f9c8e3f1a",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "7f3424e8-7f00-4b93-ab1e-247d0a64e2b4",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Clerk: STEADY\nmeans message\nreceived. DOUBLE\nmeans send the\ncourier.",
                "DARK means no\nconfirmed signal,\nso check in\nperson. No rapid",
                "flashing, and no\ncolor test. We use\na plain written\ncard at every",
                "post as well as\nthe lamp."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b0fd2fe8-d35e-43a0-a2d1-8cfa2f9174a6",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "42cccb24-0472-44a2-ac9c-d379815df027",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "A sample report\nsays someone saw a\nlamp but could not\ntell whether",
                "it was steady or\ndouble. The\nreceiver must not\ninvent a clear\ncode",
                "from an unclear\nsighting. A\nwritten received\ncard at the post\ncan",
                "resolve the doubt;\nif it cannot, the\nreceiver must\ncheck in person.",
                "The clerk\nremembers how much\ntrouble began when\nsilence was\ntreated",
                "as agreement. An\nuncertain flash\ndeserves the same\nhonest caution."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4a4a5d2f-240c-48ea-a885-cefa7b5088d3",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "45738b0b-6e9d-49eb-a998-936cb416cc55",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The card uses\nwords and distinct\nmarks. Pip can\nread it at arm",
                "length; Moxie can\nread it through a\nscarf. Nib\nproposes a gold",
                "border. The clerk\npermits the border\nafter he proves it\ncovers none",
                "of the\ninstructions."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8afb0338-77d3-47e9-ae4a-3a3bc1d141a2",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "5e6a4d05-612e-47eb-ae43-caab361d8feb",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The roof antenna\nreceives a clear\nDOUBLE signal.\nWhat action does",
                "the agreed code\nrequire?"
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ad25ed2d-bbb6-40ea-a03b-b163e2e4f8f5",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "b21d999f-605f-4884-a865-1cb01ccfeecf",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "What should the\nroof keeper do\nfirst with a\nreport that cannot",
                "distinguish the\ntwo active\nsignals? The\nwritten received\ncard is",
                "available beside\nthe lamp. No\nwarning is\ncurrently\nconfirmed. Choose",
                "a check that can\nestablish what was\nactually sent\nbefore calling",
                "either receipt or\na courier request.\nThe keeper wants a\nrule that",
                "still works on a\nmisty night."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dfeae9d8-ed03-4653-af32-317e52dbcb7f",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "537d9ffe-e53b-41e9-a16f-4080ae035046",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Moxie repeats the\nsignal and names\nthe depot handoff.\nShe asks Pip",
                "to stop calling\nher the emergency\nmiracle. A courier\nis a normal",
                "part of the plan,\nshe says. Miracles\nhave terrible\nmaintenance",
                "schedules."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    }
